{"sourceUrl":"https://law.jlu.edu.cn/info/1046/25478.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:14.298335+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://law.jlu.edu.cn/info/1046/25478.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span>根据</span><span><span>《吉林大学</span><span>202</span></span><span>7</span><span>年推荐免试攻读研究生</span><span>招生</span><span>录取工作办法》</span><span>（</span><span>校研院字</span><span><span>〔</span><span>2026〕25号）</span></span><span><span>等文件精神，现将我院</span><span>202</span></span><span>7</span><span>年接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读</span><span>硕士</span><span>研究生的有关事宜通知如下:</span></p>\n<p><span>一、申请条件</span></p>\n<p><span>1.</span><span>拥护中国共产党领导，遵纪守法，品德良好。</span></p>\n<p><span>2.</span><span>具有所在学校推免生资格的优秀应届本科毕业生。</span></p>\n<p><span>3.</span><span>学术研究兴趣浓厚，有较好的专业素养，有较强的创新意识和创新能力，有较高的培养潜质。</span></p>\n<p><span>4.</span><span>不存在考试作弊和学术不端行为。</span></p>\n<p><span>5.</span><span>身体和心理状况符合国家和招生单位规定的体检要求。</span></p>\n<p><span>二、招生计划</span></p>\n<p><span>参见</span><span><span>《吉林大学</span><span>2027年接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生招生简章及专业目录》</span></span><span><span>（</span><span>https://yzb.jlu.edu.cn/info/1047/3637.htm）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>三、报名及拟录取程序</span></p>\n<p><span>（一）信息填报</span></p>\n<p><span>申请人请</span><span><span>于</span><span>2026年</span></span><span>9月18日20:00前</span><span>扫描以下二维码进行信息填报。</span></p>\n<p><span></span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"B48D1\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://law.jlu.edu.cn/__local/9/3D/AA/067AB25F5E73EE2E5B0DCE1F058_1B169B45_B48D1.png\" title=\"B48D1\"/></p>\n<p><span>（二）提交材料</span></p>\n<p><span>完成信息填报后，请</span><span>按照顺序将</span><span><span>以下材料制作成一个</span><span>PDF文件于202</span></span><span>6</span><span><span>年</span><span>9月</span></span><span>19</span><span><span>日</span><span>16:00前发送至指定电子信箱，法学硕士发送邮箱</span></span><span><span>：</span><span>jlufxyzs@163.com；</span></span><span><span>法律硕士发送邮箱：</span><span>jlu_jm@163.com，邮件命名为“2</span></span><span>7</span><span><span>推免硕士</span><span>—姓名—申报志愿”：</span></span></p>\n<p><span>1.本人身份证、学生证扫描件</span><span>；</span></p>\n<p><span>2.</span><span>签字并加盖公章的</span><span><span>《吉林大学</span><span>202</span></span><span>7</span><span><span>年接收推荐免试研究生申请表》（附件</span><span>1）扫描件</span></span><span>；</span></p>\n<p><span>3.加盖所在学校教务部门公章的本科期间成绩单扫描件</span><span>；</span></p>\n<p><span>4.在校期间发表的论文、获得专利的证书、研究成果证明、获奖证书、外语水平考试证书等材料扫描件</span><span>；</span></p>\n<p><span>5.签字并加盖公章的《思想政治鉴定表》（附件2）扫描件。</span></p>\n<p><span>（三）复试及录取</span></p>\n<p><span>1.法学院成立研究生招生工作领导小组，对考生报名资格进行审核。</span></p>\n<p><span>2.</span><span>学院将在审核材料后，确定复试名单，并在学院官网公示。</span><span>复试采取线下面试的方式，</span><span>具体实施细则另行通知，请</span><span>各位考生</span><span>关注学院网站通知。</span></p>\n<p><span>注：已参加过我院</span><span>2026年“校园学术活动开放日”的考生且具备推荐免试硕士研究生资格者可以认定考核成绩。</span></p>\n<p><span><span><br/></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><br/></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\n<p><span>吉林大学法学院</span></p>\n<p><span>202</span><span>6</span><span><span>年</span><span>9月1</span></span><span>6</span><span>日</span></p>\n<p><span><span><br/></span></span><br/></p>\n<p><span></span><br/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"e74d4b95e0db5ece973b75e0a87f7d953ee722dd03e584fbdf1ac0e08cd8f1af","textLength":834,"sourceSha256":"6bb5a79cb9a804c0731f26aa3cf499ff8047d90414df29fa8c7723a02562493d","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"附件1：吉林大学2027年接收推荐免试研究生申请表.docx","url":"https://law.jlu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1467622662&wbfileid=18198313"},{"name":"附件2：思想政治鉴定表.docx","url":"https://law.jlu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1467622662&wbfileid=18198314"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-d1f6633efbbb74a67aa5","title":"2026年吉林大学法学院关于2027年接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读硕士研究生的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:14.298335+00:00"}
